# ── Protein FASTA files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw, merged, and split FASTA files are excluded from version control.
# They are large (hundreds of MB total), reproducible from NCBI using the
# retrieval tracker files, and would exceed GitHub's 100 MB file size limit.
*.faa
*.fasta
*.fa

# ── FASTA archives & embeddings ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The FASTA archive is published on Zenodo (not stored in git).
# Embedding .h5 files are hundreds of MB each — regenerate with compute_*.py.
*.tar.gz
*.h5
embeddings/

# ── MMseqs2 outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Clustering results and temporary files generated by MMseqs2.
# Reproducible by re-running the clustering commands documented in the thesis.
dataset_splits/mmseqs2_tmp/
dataset_splits/mmseqs2_cluster*

# ── Python cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# ── macOS system files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*

# ── Editor files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
Pfam-A.hmm
bacdive-AI/
